      "name": "sample_waypoints.h",
      "filePath": "src/waypoint_generator/src/sample_waypoints.h",
      "summary": "提供 point、circle、eight 三类预定义航点轨迹，直接构造 nav_msgs/Path 供 waypoint_generator 节点按模式选用。",
      "tags": ["工具函数", "航点", "轨迹", "header"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "C++ 头文件内联实现轨迹生成函数（扫描器标为 C），各函数硬编码 PoseStamped 序列后返回 Path。"
    },
